WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.206
Revise ideas and order first; proofread spelling, grammar and punctuation before

00:00:05.206 --> 00:00:05.661
sharing.

00:00:06.533 --> 00:00:10.501
Which step checks ideas and organisation? Answer: Revising

00:00:11.367 --> 00:00:15.591
Exchange a paragraph with a partner and mark one revision and two corrections.

00:00:16.450 --> 00:00:19.458
Discuss why: Revision improves meaning and structure.
